you'll see it's not.

6
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,320
-Ciao, Noah.
-Ciao.

7
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,400
Hey, I didn't see Nick!

8
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:45,120
Yeah, he couldn't come.

9
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:47,800
